      "text": "Working the trail"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "She went up the bamboo path. There is a trail there that does not lead anywhere interesting any more, and it took me four separate afternoons across two years to make that true.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "She walks the bamboo path at the hour it happened, and stops where the ground is wrong.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "tie-ruo-nan",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
      "actor": "tie-ruo-nan",
      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 175,
      "text": "Chapter 175"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "She asked the carter. He told her about a cart, a junction and nothing else, because that is now all he has.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 176,
      "text": "Chapter 176"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "She asked why a Rank one student's essence readings from two winters ago do not match a Rank two's. Nobody else in two years has asked that question. I had an answer ready and I did not enjoy using it.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 177,
      "text": "Chapter 177"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Tie Xue Leng is with her now. He has asked me nothing. He watches, and when he speaks it will be a conclusion rather than a question.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "choice",
